simulation Normal of pre_pkg_main::M{
	cycleDef cycle==1
}

 /*
  * Schedulability verification
  */
assertion A4: Normal is schedulable  

assertion A5: Normal refines pre_pkg_main_sim::M in the failures divergences model with cycleDef of Normal set to 1, and cycleDef of pre_pkg_main_sim::M set to 1  
assertion A6: pre_pkg_main_sim::M refines Normal in the failures divergences model with cycleDef of Normal set to 1, and cycleDef of pre_pkg_main_sim::M set to 1  